To the Office of the Attorney General,

The Attorney General issued two orders on my petitions concerning the Offic=
e of the Governor, both under DOJ File No. 121010-GA0187-26.
The order of September 24, 2026 appears in the public records order collect=
ion maintained through the State of Oregon Law Library.

The order of October 1, 2026 does not. That order dismissed my petition cha=
llenging a fee waiver denial, citing ORS 192.427 and Public Records Order, =
Oct 2, 2014, Sebens.

Please tell me why the October 1 order has not been published, and whether =
and when it will be. Also, the Sebens order no longer appears in the Law Li=
brary collection. Please provide a copy of it.

